  "description": "Source-generated strongly-typed IDs for .NET. One attribute emits equality, comparison, New() factory, EF Core ValueConverter, System.Text.Json converter, TypeConverter, and IParsable/ISpanParsable. Strategies: Guid, GuidV7, SequentialGuid, Snowflake, ULID, KSUID, ObjectId, NanoId, CUID2. Integrations: System.Text.Json, EF Core, TypeConverter, IParsable, Dapper, Newtonsoft.Json, MongoDB, Swashbuckle/OpenAPI. Compatible with Native AOT and trimming.",
